    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262080/extras/44011ea363f38ebd1b9467f38bc2e8a1.avif?t=1732270380\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Black Blood</strong> is a mix of Tower Defense and a top\u2014down shooter where you have to defend 4 lighthouses from alien invaders. Use weapons, build defensive towers and upgrade them with the help of resources extracted from defeated enemies. Your assistant will be a drone that attacks, heals and repairs your structures if you improve its capabilities. Every decision matters \u2014 choose what to spend your limited resources on: new weapons, drone upgrades, or building defenses. The game combines action, strategy and survival elements, where it is important to properly manage resources and develop tactics for each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complex protection Build towers and protect lighthouses from waves of enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assistant drone it helps in combat, treatment and repair. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of improvements upgrade weapons and structures. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense action dynamic battles with robots and aliens. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro graphics and soundtrack An atmospheric retro style game with great music.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1262080/extras/44011ea363f38ebd1b9467f38bc2e8a1.avif?t=1732270380\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Black Blood</strong> is a mix of Tower Defense and a top\u2014down shooter where you have to defend 4 lighthouses from alien invaders. Use weapons, build defensive towers and upgrade them with the help of resources extracted from defeated enemies. Your assistant will be a drone that attacks, heals and repairs your structures if you improve its capabilities. Every decision matters \u2014 choose what to spend your limited resources on: new weapons, drone upgrades, or building defenses. The game combines action, strategy and survival elements, where it is important to properly manage resources and develop tactics for each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complex protection Build towers and protect lighthouses from waves of enemies. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assistant drone it helps in combat, treatment and repair. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of improvements upgrade weapons and structures. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intense action dynamic battles with robots and aliens. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro graphics and soundtrack An atmospheric retro style game with great music.</p></li></ul>",
